- **Don't mirror it with local state.** Avoid the anti-pattern of copying the binding into a `@State` in `onAppear` and syncing it back — that reintroduces the divergence `@Binding` exists to prevent.

So: parent owns the value (`@State` or an `@Observable` model), child takes `@Binding` (for a plain value) or `@Bindable` (for a property on a model it doesn't own).

